{
  "name": "Shayona - Saree Missing Catalog Image Generator (AI)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup Required Before Activating\n1. **Set Configuration** node: fill ROOT_FOLDER_ID (parent Drive folder containing all barcode folders), GEMINI_API_MODEL (e.g. gemini-2.5-flash-image), ERROR_LOG_SPREADSHEET_ID, ERROR_LOG_SHEET_NAME.\n2. Attach a **Google Drive OAuth2** credential to every Google Drive node (search/download/upload/update).\n3. Create a **Generic Query Auth** credential named '<REDACTED>' with Query Parameter Name = `key` and Value = your Generative Language API key. Attach it to both Gemini HTTP Request nodes.\n4. Attach a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential to the error log Append node.\n5. Image roles are fixed by filename only: 1.png=Barcode/Tag, 4.png=Folded Saree, 5.png=Saree Flat (input), 6.png=Blouse Fabric (input). 5.png and 6.png are downloaded and sent directly to Gemini, which generates 2.png (catalog image) in one step. 1.png and 4.png are never touched.\n6. Retries: Drive ops x3, AI generation x3 (with continueErrorOutput + 5s wait), upload/update x3.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "7c8c72d1-84be-4044-83ea-6b021faecbe8",
